{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "遠征するときは\n荷物を極力減らすために\n使い切りのシャンプーとトリートメントを\n持っていくんだけどね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今年ツアーたくさん回るし\nいっぱい買お〜〜 って\nガバッといっぱい買ったんだー。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最近は洗面台の引き出しに残された\n彼らを見て\nちょっぴり寂しくなってる"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まさかこんなところから\n余韻を感じさせられるとは…"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "どこで何を感じるか分からないね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🧐"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ツアー2026、ありがとうございました＾＾"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "先輩って本当にかっこいい。偉大\nって何度も思ったり"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "同期のちょっとした変化に\nその目に映るものが気になったり"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "四期生から伝わる真っ直ぐさに\n心を打たれたり"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "発見が多かったです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今更過ぎないかーー。なんていう\nことにも気がついたり"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "去年と同じ行動してても\n動機が変わっていたり"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "自分自身にも変化があった期間だったな〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "￼\n￼"}, {"type